[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.168",
    "end": "00:00:09.140",
    "start_seconds": 4.168,
    "end_seconds": 9.14,
    "text": "So I recently just completed a short film about computers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.140",
    "end": "00:00:12.443",
    "start_seconds": 9.14,
    "end_seconds": 12.443,
    "text": "and I'm very excited to be able to premiere it right now at TED."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.443",
    "end": "00:00:13.477",
    "start_seconds": 12.443,
    "end_seconds": 13.477,
    "text": "(Cheers)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.511",
    "end": "00:00:14.945",
    "start_seconds": 13.511,
    "end_seconds": 14.945,
    "text": "Let's take a look. Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.945",
    "end": "00:00:16.614",
    "start_seconds": 14.945,
    "end_seconds": 16.614,
    "text": "(Soothing music)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.127",
    "end": "00:00:31.862",
    "start_seconds": 30.127,
    "end_seconds": 31.862,
    "text": "(Screaming)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.463",
    "end": "00:00:34.198",
    "start_seconds": 32.463,
    "end_seconds": 34.198,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.132",
    "end": "00:00:36.400",
    "start_seconds": 35.132,
    "end_seconds": 36.4,
    "text": "Did that scare you?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.434",
    "end": "00:00:38.102",
    "start_seconds": 36.434,
    "end_seconds": 38.102,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.135",
    "end": "00:00:42.306",
    "start_seconds": 38.135,
    "end_seconds": 42.306,
    "text": "I think that's because computers actually are kind of scary, aren't they?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.339",
    "end": "00:00:45.276",
    "start_seconds": 42.339,
    "end_seconds": 45.276,
    "text": "Hi, my name is Alan Resnick,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.309",
    "end": "00:00:48.112",
    "start_seconds": 45.309,
    "end_seconds": 48.112,
    "text": "and if you don’t know me, I’m a bit of a “tech-head.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.112",
    "end": "00:00:49.380",
    "start_seconds": 48.112,
    "end_seconds": 49.38,
    "text": "What does that mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.413",
    "end": "00:00:52.049",
    "start_seconds": 49.413,
    "end_seconds": 52.049,
    "text": "It means an average day for me is spent surfing the web,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.083",
    "end": "00:00:55.186",
    "start_seconds": 52.083,
    "end_seconds": 55.186,
    "text": "checking my emails and just clicking on links."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.219",
    "end": "00:00:57.088",
    "start_seconds": 55.219,
    "end_seconds": 57.088,
    "text": "That's sort of me in a nutshell."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.121",
    "end": "00:00:58.522",
    "start_seconds": 57.121,
    "end_seconds": 58.522,
    "text": "And when I'm not doing that,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.556",
    "end": "00:01:02.927",
    "start_seconds": 58.556,
    "end_seconds": 62.927,
    "text": "I tour the country, and I teach people how to use computers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.960",
    "end": "00:01:05.729",
    "start_seconds": 62.96,
    "end_seconds": 65.729,
    "text": "And the number one thing I've noticed all over"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.763",
    "end": "00:01:08.799",
    "start_seconds": 65.763,
    "end_seconds": 68.799,
    "text": "is that people are afraid of computers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.833",
    "end": "00:01:10.401",
    "start_seconds": 68.833,
    "end_seconds": 70.401,
    "text": "They're scared."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.434",
    "end": "00:01:14.105",
    "start_seconds": 70.434,
    "end_seconds": 74.105,
    "text": "And don't get me started on the internet, you guys."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.138",
    "end": "00:01:16.006",
    "start_seconds": 74.138,
    "end_seconds": 76.006,
    "text": "Has anyone here ever been online?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.040",
    "end": "00:01:17.174",
    "start_seconds": 76.03999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 77.174,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.208",
    "end": "00:01:19.410",
    "start_seconds": 77.208,
    "end_seconds": 79.41,
    "text": "Two, three hands."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.410",
    "end": "00:01:21.045",
    "start_seconds": 79.41,
    "end_seconds": 81.045,
    "text": "You guys gotta get online."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.078",
    "end": "00:01:22.646",
    "start_seconds": 81.078,
    "end_seconds": 82.646,
    "text": "It's incre --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.680",
    "end": "00:01:23.948",
    "start_seconds": 82.68,
    "end_seconds": 83.94800000000001,
    "text": "I'm telling you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.948",
    "end": "00:01:26.350",
    "start_seconds": 83.94800000000001,
    "end_seconds": 86.35,
    "text": "there's some crazy stuff online, you guys."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.383",
    "end": "00:01:29.320",
    "start_seconds": 86.383,
    "end_seconds": 89.32,
    "text": "I don't have time to get into it right now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.320",
    "end": "00:01:32.890",
    "start_seconds": 89.32,
    "end_seconds": 92.89,
    "text": "but they have photos and videos of people online,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.923",
    "end": "00:01:37.294",
    "start_seconds": 92.923,
    "end_seconds": 97.294,
    "text": "and they're performing a kind of love that I am not comfortable with."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.328",
    "end": "00:01:38.596",
    "start_seconds": 97.328,
    "end_seconds": 98.596,
    "text": "OK?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.629",
    "end": "00:01:39.797",
    "start_seconds": 98.62899999999999,
    "end_seconds": 99.797,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.830",
    "end": "00:01:41.098",
    "start_seconds": 99.83,
    "end_seconds": 101.098,
    "text": "And they have your data."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.032",
    "end": "00:01:44.468",
    "start_seconds": 102.032,
    "end_seconds": 104.468,
    "text": "They do. These sick people have your data."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.502",
    "end": "00:01:46.504",
    "start_seconds": 104.50200000000001,
    "end_seconds": 106.50399999999999,
    "text": "Are you comfortable with that? I'm not."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.338",
    "end": "00:01:50.274",
    "start_seconds": 107.338,
    "end_seconds": 110.274,
    "text": "But I have a question for you guys, and it is a real question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.307",
    "end": "00:01:52.676",
    "start_seconds": 110.307,
    "end_seconds": 112.676,
    "text": "How do you use your computer?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.676",
    "end": "00:01:54.378",
    "start_seconds": 112.676,
    "end_seconds": 114.378,
    "text": "How do you guys use your computers?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.378",
    "end": "00:01:56.247",
    "start_seconds": 114.378,
    "end_seconds": 116.247,
    "text": "Just curious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.247",
    "end": "00:01:57.515",
    "start_seconds": 116.247,
    "end_seconds": 117.515,
    "text": "Can we get her a mic?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.515",
    "end": "00:02:00.117",
    "start_seconds": 117.515,
    "end_seconds": 120.117,
    "text": "How do you use your computer?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.117",
    "end": "00:02:01.986",
    "start_seconds": 120.117,
    "end_seconds": 121.986,
    "text": "Audience Member: Well, I usually use"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.986",
    "end": "00:02:02.987",
    "start_seconds": 121.986,
    "end_seconds": 122.987,
    "text": "my computer for work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.987",
    "end": "00:02:05.723",
    "start_seconds": 122.987,
    "end_seconds": 125.723,
    "text": "So emails and, you know, sending messages to folks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.756",
    "end": "00:02:07.925",
    "start_seconds": 125.756,
    "end_seconds": 127.925,
    "text": "Alan Resnick: No, stop. OK. Shut up. No."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.958",
    "end": "00:02:09.760",
    "start_seconds": 127.958,
    "end_seconds": 129.76,
    "text": "OK. This is wrong."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.793",
    "end": "00:02:10.895",
    "start_seconds": 129.793,
    "end_seconds": 130.895,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.928",
    "end": "00:02:15.633",
    "start_seconds": 130.928,
    "end_seconds": 135.633,
    "text": "This is incorrect. I hate to say this, but you're using your computer wrong."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.666",
    "end": "00:02:18.435",
    "start_seconds": 135.666,
    "end_seconds": 138.435,
    "text": "You know, not \"use.\" I don't love that word \"use.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.469",
    "end": "00:02:20.738",
    "start_seconds": 138.469,
    "end_seconds": 140.738,
    "text": "We don't \"use\" computers, do we?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.738",
    "end": "00:02:24.508",
    "start_seconds": 140.738,
    "end_seconds": 144.508,
    "text": "No. I think of computers a little like grandparents, actually."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.542",
    "end": "00:02:26.510",
    "start_seconds": 144.542,
    "end_seconds": 146.51,
    "text": "You wouldn't use your grandmother, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.510",
    "end": "00:02:27.511",
    "start_seconds": 146.51,
    "end_seconds": 147.511,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.545",
    "end": "00:02:30.447",
    "start_seconds": 147.54500000000002,
    "end_seconds": 150.447,
    "text": "But your grandmother can make your life easier"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.447",
    "end": "00:02:32.716",
    "start_seconds": 150.447,
    "end_seconds": 152.716,
    "text": "if you use her properly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.750",
    "end": "00:02:35.486",
    "start_seconds": 152.75,
    "end_seconds": 155.486,
    "text": "So what is the proper way to use a computer?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.486",
    "end": "00:02:38.088",
    "start_seconds": 155.486,
    "end_seconds": 158.088,
    "text": "Tonight I'm going to share with you my one simple trick"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.122",
    "end": "00:02:40.224",
    "start_seconds": 158.122,
    "end_seconds": 160.224,
    "text": "that's going to make your life a lot easier,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.257",
    "end": "00:02:43.260",
    "start_seconds": 160.257,
    "end_seconds": 163.26,
    "text": "it's going to protect your data and it's going to calm you down."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.294",
    "end": "00:02:44.695",
    "start_seconds": 163.29399999999998,
    "end_seconds": 164.695,
    "text": "OK, here it is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.695",
    "end": "00:02:45.963",
    "start_seconds": 164.695,
    "end_seconds": 165.963,
    "text": "(Clears throat)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.864",
    "end": "00:02:48.132",
    "start_seconds": 166.864,
    "end_seconds": 168.132,
    "text": "(Whispers) Desktops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.366",
    "end": "00:02:51.569",
    "start_seconds": 169.36599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 171.56900000000002,
    "text": "Desktops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.569",
    "end": "00:02:52.836",
    "start_seconds": 171.56900000000002,
    "end_seconds": 172.836,
    "text": "What is he saying?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.870",
    "end": "00:02:54.138",
    "start_seconds": 172.87,
    "end_seconds": 174.138,
    "text": "(Whispers) Desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.171",
    "end": "00:02:57.675",
    "start_seconds": 174.171,
    "end_seconds": 177.675,
    "text": "I can't hear him. What are you saying? I'm saying save it to your desktop!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.708",
    "end": "00:03:00.110",
    "start_seconds": 177.708,
    "end_seconds": 180.11,
    "text": "It's as simple as that. Save it to your desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.110",
    "end": "00:03:01.812",
    "start_seconds": 180.11,
    "end_seconds": 181.812,
    "text": "OK? Yeah, we can clap for that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.845",
    "end": "00:03:04.148",
    "start_seconds": 181.845,
    "end_seconds": 184.148,
    "text": "That's pretty cool. That is pretty cool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.181",
    "end": "00:03:06.383",
    "start_seconds": 184.181,
    "end_seconds": 186.383,
    "text": "You're going, \"Alan, it can't be that easy.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.383",
    "end": "00:03:07.384",
    "start_seconds": 186.383,
    "end_seconds": 187.38400000000001,
    "text": "It is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.384",
    "end": "00:03:09.153",
    "start_seconds": 187.38400000000001,
    "end_seconds": 189.153,
    "text": "But before we can talk about desktops,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.153",
    "end": "00:03:11.956",
    "start_seconds": 189.153,
    "end_seconds": 191.956,
    "text": "we have to talk about something else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.956",
    "end": "00:03:14.491",
    "start_seconds": 191.956,
    "end_seconds": 194.49099999999999,
    "text": "Look at this. Check this out. This is pretty cool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.059",
    "end": "00:03:17.261",
    "start_seconds": 195.059,
    "end_seconds": 197.261,
    "text": "Look at that. You see this?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.261",
    "end": "00:03:18.329",
    "start_seconds": 197.261,
    "end_seconds": 198.329,
    "text": "My skin. Look at --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.329",
    "end": "00:03:19.363",
    "start_seconds": 198.329,
    "end_seconds": 199.363,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.363",
    "end": "00:03:21.198",
    "start_seconds": 199.363,
    "end_seconds": 201.198,
    "text": "My skin is vibrating."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.198",
    "end": "00:03:24.101",
    "start_seconds": 201.198,
    "end_seconds": 204.101,
    "text": "But it's vibrating -- it's very hard to tell."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.134",
    "end": "00:03:26.337",
    "start_seconds": 204.13400000000001,
    "end_seconds": 206.337,
    "text": "It's hard to see. Here. This is vibrating, too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.370",
    "end": "00:03:29.073",
    "start_seconds": 206.37,
    "end_seconds": 209.073,
    "text": "But I think you'll be able to see this. Can you see that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.073",
    "end": "00:03:30.341",
    "start_seconds": 209.073,
    "end_seconds": 210.341,
    "text": "Light vibrates too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.374",
    "end": "00:03:32.643",
    "start_seconds": 210.374,
    "end_seconds": 212.643,
    "text": "Are you -- I need a response."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.676",
    "end": "00:03:34.278",
    "start_seconds": 212.676,
    "end_seconds": 214.278,
    "text": "Can you see that? You can? OK."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.278",
    "end": "00:03:35.613",
    "start_seconds": 214.278,
    "end_seconds": 215.613,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.613",
    "end": "00:03:38.215",
    "start_seconds": 215.613,
    "end_seconds": 218.215,
    "text": "That's because of the eye-brain system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.249",
    "end": "00:03:40.784",
    "start_seconds": 218.249,
    "end_seconds": 220.784,
    "text": "The visible spectrum. Rods and cones. Rods and cones."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.784",
    "end": "00:03:42.052",
    "start_seconds": 220.784,
    "end_seconds": 222.052,
    "text": "Rods and cones."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.086",
    "end": "00:03:44.188",
    "start_seconds": 222.086,
    "end_seconds": 224.188,
    "text": "But my skin is vibrating, too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.221",
    "end": "00:03:47.491",
    "start_seconds": 224.221,
    "end_seconds": 227.49099999999999,
    "text": "But it vibrates at a rate that you can't see or perceive,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.491",
    "end": "00:03:51.228",
    "start_seconds": 227.49099999999999,
    "end_seconds": 231.228,
    "text": "but dogs and pets can actually hear."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.262",
    "end": "00:03:53.364",
    "start_seconds": 231.262,
    "end_seconds": 233.364,
    "text": "They hear our skin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.364",
    "end": "00:03:55.633",
    "start_seconds": 233.364,
    "end_seconds": 235.633,
    "text": "So I know you like to touch a little dog's head."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.666",
    "end": "00:03:56.900",
    "start_seconds": 235.666,
    "end_seconds": 236.9,
    "text": "(Imitates barking)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.934",
    "end": "00:04:00.738",
    "start_seconds": 236.934,
    "end_seconds": 240.738,
    "text": "But that passive action is actually causing them extreme inner ear pain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.738",
    "end": "00:04:02.239",
    "start_seconds": 240.738,
    "end_seconds": 242.239,
    "text": "so you shouldn't touch dogs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.239",
    "end": "00:04:03.941",
    "start_seconds": 242.239,
    "end_seconds": 243.941,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.974",
    "end": "00:04:05.509",
    "start_seconds": 243.974,
    "end_seconds": 245.50900000000001,
    "text": "But here's what you didn't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.611",
    "end": "00:04:09.113",
    "start_seconds": 247.611,
    "end_seconds": 249.113,
    "text": "My computer vibrates too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.113",
    "end": "00:04:10.948",
    "start_seconds": 249.113,
    "end_seconds": 250.948,
    "text": "Did you know that? Computers vibrate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.948",
    "end": "00:04:15.052",
    "start_seconds": 250.948,
    "end_seconds": 255.052,
    "text": "And they happen to vibrate at the exact opposite rate as human skin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.085",
    "end": "00:04:16.387",
    "start_seconds": 255.085,
    "end_seconds": 256.387,
    "text": "That's amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.420",
    "end": "00:04:20.057",
    "start_seconds": 256.42,
    "end_seconds": 260.057,
    "text": "So when you're working with a computer, those vibrations are phasing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.090",
    "end": "00:04:24.028",
    "start_seconds": 260.09,
    "end_seconds": 264.028,
    "text": "And when you touch a computer, you have a vibration rate of zero."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.028",
    "end": "00:04:26.397",
    "start_seconds": 264.028,
    "end_seconds": 266.397,
    "text": "There is only one moment in every person's life"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.430",
    "end": "00:04:28.399",
    "start_seconds": 266.43,
    "end_seconds": 268.399,
    "text": "when they have a vibration rate of zero,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.432",
    "end": "00:04:33.070",
    "start_seconds": 268.432,
    "end_seconds": 273.07,
    "text": "and that is on their fifth birthday, when they blow out the candle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.070",
    "end": "00:04:35.005",
    "start_seconds": 273.07,
    "end_seconds": 275.005,
    "text": "So you go on, \"Alan, you convinced me.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.039",
    "end": "00:04:37.408",
    "start_seconds": 275.039,
    "end_seconds": 277.408,
    "text": "If working with computers feels even half as good"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.408",
    "end": "00:04:38.976",
    "start_seconds": 277.408,
    "end_seconds": 278.976,
    "text": "as a little boy's birthday,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.009",
    "end": "00:04:40.544",
    "start_seconds": 279.009,
    "end_seconds": 280.544,
    "text": "then sign me up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.577",
    "end": "00:04:44.982",
    "start_seconds": 280.577,
    "end_seconds": 284.98199999999997,
    "text": "The glove is off and we're ready to change our lives forever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.015",
    "end": "00:04:46.283",
    "start_seconds": 285.015,
    "end_seconds": 286.283,
    "text": "But how?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.283",
    "end": "00:04:47.551",
    "start_seconds": 286.283,
    "end_seconds": 287.551,
    "text": "(Whispers) Desktops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.584",
    "end": "00:04:49.019",
    "start_seconds": 287.584,
    "end_seconds": 289.019,
    "text": "I already told you, desktops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.053",
    "end": "00:04:51.221",
    "start_seconds": 289.053,
    "end_seconds": 291.221,
    "text": "Save it to your desktop! I already said that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.255",
    "end": "00:04:52.823",
    "start_seconds": 291.255,
    "end_seconds": 292.823,
    "text": "Save it to your desktop. OK."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.823",
    "end": "00:04:53.924",
    "start_seconds": 292.823,
    "end_seconds": 293.924,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.957",
    "end": "00:04:55.392",
    "start_seconds": 293.957,
    "end_seconds": 295.392,
    "text": "I think you're ready."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.027",
    "end": "00:04:58.762",
    "start_seconds": 297.027,
    "end_seconds": 298.762,
    "text": "Do you guys want to see my desktop?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.762",
    "end": "00:05:01.365",
    "start_seconds": 298.762,
    "end_seconds": 301.365,
    "text": "Audience: Yes. Show me your desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.365",
    "end": "00:05:02.366",
    "start_seconds": 301.365,
    "end_seconds": 302.366,
    "text": "AR: I can’t hear you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.366",
    "end": "00:05:04.134",
    "start_seconds": 302.366,
    "end_seconds": 304.134,
    "text": "Do you guys want to see my desktop?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.134",
    "end": "00:05:06.036",
    "start_seconds": 304.134,
    "end_seconds": 306.036,
    "text": "Come on! OK, let's do it!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.036",
    "end": "00:05:08.439",
    "start_seconds": 306.036,
    "end_seconds": 308.439,
    "text": "Here we go. Let's get it booted up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.439",
    "end": "00:05:11.008",
    "start_seconds": 308.439,
    "end_seconds": 311.008,
    "text": "Here it is. It's my desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.008",
    "end": "00:05:12.443",
    "start_seconds": 311.008,
    "end_seconds": 312.443,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.443",
    "end": "00:05:13.711",
    "start_seconds": 312.443,
    "end_seconds": 313.711,
    "text": "That's amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.744",
    "end": "00:05:16.647",
    "start_seconds": 313.744,
    "end_seconds": 316.647,
    "text": "You're going, \"Alan, I could never have something like that.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.680",
    "end": "00:05:19.216",
    "start_seconds": 316.68,
    "end_seconds": 319.216,
    "text": "If you follow my simple rule, save it to your desktop,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.249",
    "end": "00:05:21.552",
    "start_seconds": 319.249,
    "end_seconds": 321.552,
    "text": "you're not only going to have an awesome desktop,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.585",
    "end": "00:05:24.088",
    "start_seconds": 321.585,
    "end_seconds": 324.088,
    "text": "you're actually going to have a wicked, awesome life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.121",
    "end": "00:05:25.923",
    "start_seconds": 324.121,
    "end_seconds": 325.923,
    "text": "Now check this out. This is cool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.956",
    "end": "00:05:28.525",
    "start_seconds": 325.956,
    "end_seconds": 328.525,
    "text": "The desktop --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.559",
    "end": "00:05:33.097",
    "start_seconds": 328.559,
    "end_seconds": 333.097,
    "text": "is a little like my desk's top surface, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.097",
    "end": "00:05:35.032",
    "start_seconds": 333.097,
    "end_seconds": 335.032,
    "text": "So I have file folders on the computer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.032",
    "end": "00:05:38.068",
    "start_seconds": 335.032,
    "end_seconds": 338.068,
    "text": "And guess what? I got them here too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.068",
    "end": "00:05:40.904",
    "start_seconds": 338.068,
    "end_seconds": 340.904,
    "text": "What kind of things can you save to your desktop? Anything."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.904",
    "end": "00:05:45.275",
    "start_seconds": 340.904,
    "end_seconds": 345.275,
    "text": "You can have photos, emails, PDFs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.309",
    "end": "00:05:46.643",
    "start_seconds": 345.30899999999997,
    "end_seconds": 346.64300000000003,
    "text": "Those are like packets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.677",
    "end": "00:05:50.214",
    "start_seconds": 346.677,
    "end_seconds": 350.214,
    "text": "You can have movies, video games,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.247",
    "end": "00:05:54.318",
    "start_seconds": 350.247,
    "end_seconds": 354.318,
    "text": "key codes, MP3s, zip disks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.318",
    "end": "00:05:57.821",
    "start_seconds": 354.318,
    "end_seconds": 357.821,
    "text": "These are all useful things that you can save to your desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.821",
    "end": "00:05:59.990",
    "start_seconds": 357.821,
    "end_seconds": 359.99,
    "text": "So it's sort of an organizational technique."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.990",
    "end": "00:06:01.658",
    "start_seconds": 359.99,
    "end_seconds": 361.658,
    "text": "So I'll give you an example."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.658",
    "end": "00:06:05.396",
    "start_seconds": 361.658,
    "end_seconds": 365.396,
    "text": "Let's say your dad emails you some pics of the lawn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.429",
    "end": "00:06:07.898",
    "start_seconds": 365.429,
    "end_seconds": 367.898,
    "text": "All you have to do is ..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.931",
    "end": "00:06:12.002",
    "start_seconds": 367.931,
    "end_seconds": 372.002,
    "text": "OK. Yeah, you got to just save them to the desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.337",
    "end": "00:06:15.606",
    "start_seconds": 373.337,
    "end_seconds": 375.606,
    "text": "Just save those right to the desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.639",
    "end": "00:06:16.974",
    "start_seconds": 375.639,
    "end_seconds": 376.974,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.007",
    "end": "00:06:20.644",
    "start_seconds": 377.007,
    "end_seconds": 380.644,
    "text": "And after you do that, you're going to want to print out a copy for yourself,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.677",
    "end": "00:06:22.880",
    "start_seconds": 380.677,
    "end_seconds": 382.88,
    "text": "which you're going to place on your desk's top."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.913",
    "end": "00:06:25.616",
    "start_seconds": 382.913,
    "end_seconds": 385.616,
    "text": "Can I get those photos? Where the heck are those photos?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.616",
    "end": "00:06:26.884",
    "start_seconds": 385.616,
    "end_seconds": 386.884,
    "text": "Oh, thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.917",
    "end": "00:06:28.919",
    "start_seconds": 386.91700000000003,
    "end_seconds": 388.919,
    "text": "So --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.952",
    "end": "00:06:30.421",
    "start_seconds": 388.952,
    "end_seconds": 390.421,
    "text": "This is cool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.454",
    "end": "00:06:32.523",
    "start_seconds": 390.454,
    "end_seconds": 392.523,
    "text": "So now you always know where everything is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.556",
    "end": "00:06:34.358",
    "start_seconds": 392.556,
    "end_seconds": 394.358,
    "text": "You're not going to lose anything."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.391",
    "end": "00:06:37.728",
    "start_seconds": 394.391,
    "end_seconds": 397.728,
    "text": "I'll give you another example. I'm just going to pick a file at random."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.761",
    "end": "00:06:39.897",
    "start_seconds": 397.761,
    "end_seconds": 399.897,
    "text": "Let's just pick a random file."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.930",
    "end": "00:06:42.032",
    "start_seconds": 399.93,
    "end_seconds": 402.032,
    "text": "OK? Eeny meeny miny moe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.032",
    "end": "00:06:43.967",
    "start_seconds": 402.032,
    "end_seconds": 403.967,
    "text": "Catch a tiger by the t --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.001",
    "end": "00:06:45.235",
    "start_seconds": 404.001,
    "end_seconds": 405.235,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.004",
    "end": "00:06:49.239",
    "start_seconds": 407.004,
    "end_seconds": 409.239,
    "text": "This is a little embarrassing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.239",
    "end": "00:06:51.675",
    "start_seconds": 409.239,
    "end_seconds": 411.675,
    "text": "This is actually an old poem I wrote."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.708",
    "end": "00:06:53.310",
    "start_seconds": 411.70799999999997,
    "end_seconds": 413.31,
    "text": "Egg on my face. It says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.343",
    "end": "00:06:57.681",
    "start_seconds": 413.343,
    "end_seconds": 417.681,
    "text": "\"Why whisper when a yell can travel just as far?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.714",
    "end": "00:07:00.984",
    "start_seconds": 417.714,
    "end_seconds": 420.984,
    "text": "A whisper yelled is a whisper heard.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.984",
    "end": "00:07:02.586",
    "start_seconds": 420.984,
    "end_seconds": 422.586,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.619",
    "end": "00:07:04.788",
    "start_seconds": 422.619,
    "end_seconds": 424.788,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:06.757",
    "end": "00:07:10.928",
    "start_seconds": 426.757,
    "end_seconds": 430.928,
    "text": "So where did I save that? Let's see. Where did I save that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.495",
    "end": "00:07:13.730",
    "start_seconds": 431.495,
    "end_seconds": 433.73,
    "text": "It looks like I put that on..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.764",
    "end": "00:07:19.269",
    "start_seconds": 433.764,
    "end_seconds": 439.269,
    "text": "OK, that's C5, that's the bottom right corner of my desk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.303",
    "end": "00:07:20.804",
    "start_seconds": 439.303,
    "end_seconds": 440.804,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.838",
    "end": "00:07:22.072",
    "start_seconds": 440.838,
    "end_seconds": 442.072,
    "text": "So it should be here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.540",
    "end": "00:07:24.808",
    "start_seconds": 443.54,
    "end_seconds": 444.808,
    "text": "Oh, Goddamn it!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.375",
    "end": "00:07:26.677",
    "start_seconds": 445.375,
    "end_seconds": 446.677,
    "text": "Oh! Boom! Here it is!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.710",
    "end": "00:07:29.146",
    "start_seconds": 446.71,
    "end_seconds": 449.146,
    "text": "Wow! You can clap for that. That's cool!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.179",
    "end": "00:07:30.781",
    "start_seconds": 449.179,
    "end_seconds": 450.781,
    "text": "This is amazing. This is amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.781",
    "end": "00:07:31.882",
    "start_seconds": 450.781,
    "end_seconds": 451.882,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.915",
    "end": "00:07:35.185",
    "start_seconds": 451.915,
    "end_seconds": 455.185,
    "text": "Now I'm noticing there's a couple eagle-eyed viewers in the audience,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.219",
    "end": "00:07:36.887",
    "start_seconds": 455.219,
    "end_seconds": 456.887,
    "text": "and they're looking at my computer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.920",
    "end": "00:07:39.523",
    "start_seconds": 456.92,
    "end_seconds": 459.523,
    "text": "and they're going, \"Something's up, something's up.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.556",
    "end": "00:07:43.594",
    "start_seconds": 459.556,
    "end_seconds": 463.594,
    "text": "You're going, \"Alan, where the heck is your toolbar?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.627",
    "end": "00:07:46.263",
    "start_seconds": 463.627,
    "end_seconds": 466.263,
    "text": "Or dock. Some people call it dock. I call it a toolbar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.296",
    "end": "00:07:48.966",
    "start_seconds": 466.296,
    "end_seconds": 468.966,
    "text": "\"Where's your toolbar?\" Well, guess what."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.999",
    "end": "00:07:51.768",
    "start_seconds": 468.999,
    "end_seconds": 471.76800000000003,
    "text": "My computer doesn't have a toolbar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.802",
    "end": "00:07:55.272",
    "start_seconds": 471.802,
    "end_seconds": 475.272,
    "text": "Why? I'm not addicted to my toolbar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.305",
    "end": "00:07:58.108",
    "start_seconds": 475.305,
    "end_seconds": 478.108,
    "text": "You think America's got an obesity problem?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.141",
    "end": "00:08:01.712",
    "start_seconds": 478.141,
    "end_seconds": 481.712,
    "text": "You think we have a fentanyl problem? Folks, we have a toolbar problem."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.745",
    "end": "00:08:03.714",
    "start_seconds": 481.745,
    "end_seconds": 483.714,
    "text": "Stop using your toolbar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.747",
    "end": "00:08:06.817",
    "start_seconds": 483.747,
    "end_seconds": 486.817,
    "text": "There is room for everything you need right here on the desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.850",
    "end": "00:08:08.085",
    "start_seconds": 486.85,
    "end_seconds": 488.085,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.993",
    "end": "00:08:17.261",
    "start_seconds": 495.993,
    "end_seconds": 497.261,
    "text": "This is silly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.495",
    "end": "00:08:20.464",
    "start_seconds": 498.495,
    "end_seconds": 500.464,
    "text": "This is my --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.497",
    "end": "00:08:22.132",
    "start_seconds": 500.497,
    "end_seconds": 502.132,
    "text": "My girlfriend,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.165",
    "end": "00:08:24.434",
    "start_seconds": 502.165,
    "end_seconds": 504.434,
    "text": "my ex-girlfriend, actually, made this for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.468",
    "end": "00:08:25.469",
    "start_seconds": 504.468,
    "end_seconds": 505.469,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.502",
    "end": "00:08:26.737",
    "start_seconds": 505.502,
    "end_seconds": 506.737,
    "text": "And, uh..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.504",
    "end": "00:08:30.407",
    "start_seconds": 507.504,
    "end_seconds": 510.407,
    "text": "I don't know, it's silly, but I like to look at it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.407",
    "end": "00:08:31.942",
    "start_seconds": 510.407,
    "end_seconds": 511.942,
    "text": "It makes me happy to see this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:31.975",
    "end": "00:08:33.410",
    "start_seconds": 511.975,
    "end_seconds": 513.41,
    "text": "so I --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:33.410",
    "end": "00:08:34.511",
    "start_seconds": 513.41,
    "end_seconds": 514.511,
    "text": "(Sighs)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.545",
    "end": "00:08:36.980",
    "start_seconds": 514.545,
    "end_seconds": 516.98,
    "text": "I keep it on my desk while I work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:37.014",
    "end": "00:08:38.248",
    "start_seconds": 517.014,
    "end_seconds": 518.248,
    "text": "But, uh --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.583",
    "end": "00:08:40.817",
    "start_seconds": 519.583,
    "end_seconds": 520.817,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:41.618",
    "end": "00:08:44.054",
    "start_seconds": 521.618,
    "end_seconds": 524.054,
    "text": "No, no, it's, um --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.955",
    "end": "00:08:46.456",
    "start_seconds": 524.955,
    "end_seconds": 526.456,
    "text": "It's not in the computer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:48.292",
    "end": "00:08:51.261",
    "start_seconds": 528.292,
    "end_seconds": 531.261,
    "text": "Yet! But literally anything can be saved to your desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:51.295",
    "end": "00:08:56.033",
    "start_seconds": 531.295,
    "end_seconds": 536.033,
    "text": "All you have to do is rig up a camera around a bucket at 90 degrees."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.033",
    "end": "00:08:58.669",
    "start_seconds": 536.033,
    "end_seconds": 538.669,
    "text": "You're going to want to fill the bucket with black water"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.702",
    "end": "00:09:00.470",
    "start_seconds": 538.702,
    "end_seconds": 540.47,
    "text": "and paint your beloved object white."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:00.504",
    "end": "00:09:02.472",
    "start_seconds": 540.504,
    "end_seconds": 542.472,
    "text": "And here's what you do. It's really easy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.506",
    "end": "00:09:06.009",
    "start_seconds": 542.506,
    "end_seconds": 546.009,
    "text": "You submerge the object in the water and film yourself as you pull it up,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.043",
    "end": "00:09:07.811",
    "start_seconds": 546.043,
    "end_seconds": 547.811,
    "text": "recording its topology through time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:07.844",
    "end": "00:09:10.948",
    "start_seconds": 547.844,
    "end_seconds": 550.948,
    "text": "You're going to get the topology of every axis, axes, axi."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.948",
    "end": "00:09:14.351",
    "start_seconds": 550.948,
    "end_seconds": 554.351,
    "text": "And once you have the axis data, all you have to do is boolean the axis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:14.384",
    "end": "00:09:17.521",
    "start_seconds": 554.384,
    "end_seconds": 557.521,
    "text": "You’re going to end up with an OBJ file that’s super high quality,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:17.554",
    "end": "00:09:20.490",
    "start_seconds": 557.554,
    "end_seconds": 560.49,
    "text": "you can render in an infinite quality of lighting conditions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:20.490",
    "end": "00:09:22.559",
    "start_seconds": 560.49,
    "end_seconds": 562.559,
    "text": "And then there's only one thing left to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.593",
    "end": "00:09:23.894",
    "start_seconds": 562.593,
    "end_seconds": 563.894,
    "text": "What are we going to do?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:23.894",
    "end": "00:09:25.596",
    "start_seconds": 563.894,
    "end_seconds": 565.596,
    "text": "(Audience) Save it to your desktop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:25.596",
    "end": "00:09:27.664",
    "start_seconds": 565.596,
    "end_seconds": 567.664,
    "text": "AR: Yes. Oh my God. Save it to your desktop!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.664",
    "end": "00:09:29.833",
    "start_seconds": 567.664,
    "end_seconds": 569.833,
    "text": "Yes! Woo! If you do this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.833",
    "end": "00:09:32.636",
    "start_seconds": 569.833,
    "end_seconds": 572.636,
    "text": "you will always have the things you want and need and love,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.669",
    "end": "00:09:34.805",
    "start_seconds": 572.669,
    "end_seconds": 574.805,
    "text": "and you will know exactly where to find them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:34.838",
    "end": "00:09:36.506",
    "start_seconds": 574.838,
    "end_seconds": 576.506,
    "text": "You never have to be lonely again."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:36.540",
    "end": "00:09:38.609",
    "start_seconds": 576.54,
    "end_seconds": 578.609,
    "text": "You will be happy and people will love you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:38.642",
    "end": "00:09:42.212",
    "start_seconds": 578.642,
    "end_seconds": 582.212,
    "text": "Listen, if you don't have organizational skills and desktop skills,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:42.245",
    "end": "00:09:45.315",
    "start_seconds": 582.245,
    "end_seconds": 585.315,
    "text": "I'm sorry, folks, you're not going to get that job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:45.349",
    "end": "00:09:48.385",
    "start_seconds": 585.349,
    "end_seconds": 588.385,
    "text": "Your data, it's going to be leaking on the floor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:48.418",
    "end": "00:09:52.022",
    "start_seconds": 588.418,
    "end_seconds": 592.022,
    "text": "People are going to be slipping. They're going to be slipping on your data."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:52.055",
    "end": "00:09:53.757",
    "start_seconds": 592.055,
    "end_seconds": 593.757,
    "text": "You can say \"bye-bye\" to your kids."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:53.790",
    "end": "00:09:56.360",
    "start_seconds": 593.79,
    "end_seconds": 596.36,
    "text": "They're going to be living on their desktops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.360",
    "end": "00:10:00.297",
    "start_seconds": 596.36,
    "end_seconds": 600.297,
    "text": "Mark my words, in one year's time, people will literally be,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:00.330",
    "end": "00:10:02.799",
    "start_seconds": 600.33,
    "end_seconds": 602.799,
    "text": "blah, blah, blah, blah, talking to their computers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:02.799",
    "end": "00:10:05.502",
    "start_seconds": 602.799,
    "end_seconds": 605.502,
    "text": "Whoa. In two years, people are going to be walking around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:05.535",
    "end": "00:10:08.672",
    "start_seconds": 605.535,
    "end_seconds": 608.672,
    "text": "with glasses so powerful they're never going to need to come home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:08.705",
    "end": "00:10:11.174",
    "start_seconds": 608.705,
    "end_seconds": 611.174,
    "text": "And in three years' time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:11.208",
    "end": "00:10:12.943",
    "start_seconds": 611.208,
    "end_seconds": 612.943,
    "text": "computers will have gotten so small"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:12.943",
    "end": "00:10:16.546",
    "start_seconds": 612.943,
    "end_seconds": 616.546,
    "text": "they will literally fit on a piece of breakable glass."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:18.448",
    "end": "00:10:20.183",
    "start_seconds": 618.448,
    "end_seconds": 620.183,
    "text": "(Groans)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:21.451",
    "end": "00:10:22.519",
    "start_seconds": 621.451,
    "end_seconds": 622.519,
    "text": "(Crack)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.552",
    "end": "00:10:24.721",
    "start_seconds": 622.552,
    "end_seconds": 624.721,
    "text": "Whew! OK. Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:24.755",
    "end": "00:10:26.023",
    "start_seconds": 624.755,
    "end_seconds": 626.023,
    "text": "My name is Alan Resnick."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.056",
    "end": "00:10:28.392",
    "start_seconds": 626.056,
    "end_seconds": 628.392,
    "text": "I really hope that helped. You've been incredible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:28.392",
    "end": "00:10:30.894",
    "start_seconds": 628.392,
    "end_seconds": 630.894,
    "text": "I love you so much. Good night. Thank you, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:30.927",
    "end": "00:10:32.562",
    "start_seconds": 630.927,
    "end_seconds": 632.562,
    "text": "Thank you, thank you, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:32.596",
    "end": "00:10:34.131",
    "start_seconds": 632.596,
    "end_seconds": 634.131,
    "text": "(Applause and cheers)"
  }
]
